  "description": "A fluent role-based authorization library for ASP.NET Core Minimal APIs using Clerk as the identity provider. Provides opaque token validation middleware, testable authorization service, and an expressive fluent API for role-based access control (.Single(), .OneOf(), .AllOf()). Includes ConfigureAwait(false) for all async operations and CancellationToken support.",
